Release Notes

*Insites Components* `v3.4.9` — pinned at `v3/3.4.9` (TW#26955888)

Header dialogs and menus dim the whole page.

- The keyboard-shortcuts dialog (`?`) and the production switch warning drew their scrim inside `ins-header`, a stacking context at z-index 30, so the rail (40) and an edit screen's fixed DELETE/SAVE bar (`.footer-buttons-wrapper`, 100 in the shared `dist/styles/app.min.css`) stayed bright above an open dialog and took its clicks, and `?` pressed inside an open drawer (9999) opened the shortcuts underneath it. The header now takes `--iia-z-modal` (10000) while a dialog is open, so the scrim covers the rail, the bar and the modules' drawers and modals, and a click outside the dialog closes it.
- The instance switcher and account menu raise the header to `--iia-z-header-raised`, now 106 (was 80), so their scrim covers the bar too, and on a phone the docked switcher's last rows are no longer under the bar's stacked buttons.
- A header button focused from the keyboard behind an open dialog no longer drops the dialog to the raised level: the tooltip rule skips `.iia-hdr-host--modal`.
- Includes 3.4.8 (TW#26946871, flyouts above the action bar) and 3.4.7 (TW#26923706).

Reaches every v6 instance once `v3/latest` is promoted to 3.4.9: CRM v6.1.6 loads `v3/latest` unless the instance sets `INSITES_COMPONENTS_PIN`, which keeps its tested 3.4.8. *Rollback*: `scripts/promote.sh 3.4.8`.

