*Insites Components* `v3.4.7` — pinned at `v3/3.4.7` (TW#26923706)

Field tooltips open on read-only (disabled) fields.

- `ins-input-file` (image, file and media fields) had `pointer-events: none` on the whole element when read-only, so the label's tooltip could not be hovered or clicked: on the Data item View page every upload field's tooltip was dead while Edit worked (MEA, reported by Lee). View pages set `readonly` (the shared `dist/styles/app.min.css` disables a readonly `ins-input-file`), and this bundle disables `[disabled]` itself; in both states the tooltip takes pointer events again while the dropzone, inputs and buttons stay disabled.
- Checked the other data-entry components: `ins-card-select`, `ins-button-group`, `ins-checkbox-card` and `ins-input-slider` disable only their controls (cards, buttons, the range), never the label, and `ins-input`, `ins-textarea`, `ins-select` and the date pickers carry no whole-element rule, so `ins-input-file` was the only one.

Reaches an instance when its CRM loader pins `v3/3.4.7`. *Rollback*: re-pin CRM to `v3/3.4.6`.

